    "body": "It would be good to also turn this into more of an algorithm, e.g.:\r\n\r\n> `Let <var>context</var> be the result of running the <span>...</span> given <span>this</span> and <var>options</var>.`\r\n\r\nReplacing \"this canvas element\" with \"this\" at the same time seems worthwhile.\r\n\r\nThen the third step would just return `<var>context</var>`.\r\n\r\nThis comment applies analogously to the other changes.",
